        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCBELCOM, Bellagio Lever with Arc Rose Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Bellagio Lever with Arc Rose Combo has a single cylinder lock that is operated by a thumbturn on the interior and a key from the exterior. The Arc Entryset with Bellagio Lever will fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Choose from a wide array of finishes. This Single Cylinder Bellagio Leverset With Arc Rose has a timeless beauty, making it an excellent choice for traditional homes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCBELCOM Single Cylinder Bellagio Leverset With Arc Rose:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Bellagio Lever with Arc Rose Combo:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Projection: 1.90\"</li>\r\n<li>Arc Rose Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Arc Rose Width: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Arc Deadbolt Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Arc Deadbolt Width: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARC-BEL-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262385\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCBELCOM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
